  "rules": {
    "authority": "Only owner-sent io.atum.conversation state at empty key is accepted. Owner identity comes from already-authorized assistant-room membership, not marker data. Invalid or nonowner state is unmarked; read failures are explicit.",
    "resolver": "Private assistant rooms only. Explicit earlier always refuses turns. Readable mains: greatest at, then lowest room ID. Main losers earlier, unmarked rooms stray. Unreachable never main or writable. Any transient keeps previous whole result; without previous throw matrix_conversation_unavailable, never legacy by error.",
    "ranking": "For proposals sort recent owner messages within inclusive 30 days first, newest first; otherwise last activity newest first; otherwise oldest creation first. Missing creation sorts last. Tie lowest room ID. Future owner timestamps do not count as recent.",
    "migration": "All gates before any write. Owner-chosen readable/writable main first, then other preflight-writable rooms sorted by ID as earlier. On failure clear all successfully written rooms with {} in reverse order; retry failed clears visibly, never report success. A crash after main yields coherent stray rooms completed by sweep.",
    "sweep": "With resolved main, only earlier and stray readable rooms get earlier pointing to winner. Never main and never unreachable. No writes on transient or legacy.",
    "notice": "Static localized m.notice at most once per room per UTC day from current lease holder, zero model calls, ledger claims or holds. Persist last successful day; clock moving backwards cannot resend. Rare double-host notices accepted.",
    "threads": "v1 ignores unknown marker keys but they carry no authority. Threads remain refused under agent-turns. No reset, fresh marker, epoch, divider or automatic rotation.",
    "cloud_freeze": "Proposed a/b/c requires written A-APP and C-CT acknowledgement before merge; see README. readAssistantRoom forTurn runs in existing shared Matrix SDK host; readConversationMarker returns owner-checked role/main/at or null; J4 protect_first_n=0 precedes real cloud links."
  },
